msgid "Creates \"{branch}\" on top of the base \"{base}\" from the box's {count} commit.\nThe work is done on the scratch branch \"{scratch}\", and then Zed returns to \"{origin}\"."
msgid_plural "Creates \"{branch}\" on top of the base \"{base}\" by squashing the box's {count} commits into one.\nThe work is done on the scratch branch \"{scratch}\", and then Zed returns to \"{origin}\"."
msgstr[0] "상자의 커밋 {count}개를 하나로 합쳐 기준 \"{base}\" 위에 \"{branch}\"을(를) 만듭니다.\n작업은 임시 브랜치 \"{scratch}\"에서 이루어지며, 그 후 ForgeKairos가 \"{origin}\"(으)로 돌아갑니다."

msgid "Creates a new branch (a line of work) starting at this commit. Your current work stays as it is"
msgstr "이 커밋에서 시작하는 새 브랜치(작업 줄기)를 만듭니다. 현재 작업은 그대로 유지됩니다"

msgid "Creates a new branch starting from the default branch (main, for example) instead of the current branch"
